# Rain on the Windowsill
# Dialogic source. Line signals drive the cinematic layout and save checkpoints.
label line_0
[signal arg="line:0:Rin:protected"]
The rosemary is leaning toward the glass.
label line_1
[signal arg="line:1:You:protected"]
I could move it outside.
label line_2
[signal arg="line:2:Rin:protected"]
Not yet. It needs to learn the weather a little at a time.
label line_3
[signal arg="line:3:You:protected"]
You sound like the gardener your father used to call you.
label line_4
[signal arg="line:4:Rin:protected"]
I would rather be the gardener I might become.
label line_5
[signal arg="line:5:Narrator:protected"]
Together, you turn the pot toward the light.
